Dataset: German and EU energy-saving regulatory window periods, 2022–2023.

Provenance: Derived from two public-law instruments whose date facts are not
copyrightable:

1. Kurzfristenergieversorgungssicherungsmaßnahmenverordnung (EnSikuMaV):
   in force 2022-09-01 00:00 CEST (= 2022-08-31 22:00 UTC) through the end
   of 2023-04-15 23:00 CEST (= 2023-04-15 21:00 UTC), including the extension
   of 2023-02-13.

2. Council Regulation (EU) 2022/1854 on an emergency intervention to address
   high energy prices: mandatory −5 % peak-hour consumption reduction window
   2022-12-01 00:00 CET (= 2022-11-30 23:00 UTC) through 2023-03-31 23:00 CEST
   (= 2023-03-31 21:00 UTC).

Local-midnight boundaries converted to UTC; inclusive end = last covered hour.
